OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal workers found during
OL,4,Arestaurant raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Chinese restaurant in York could be
OL,7,Fstripped of its licence after
OL,8,Fimmigration raids found people working
OL,9,Fthere illegally.
OL,11,FSky Blue Chinese restaurant and karaoke
OL,12,Fbar was visited by immigration officers
OL,13,Fin July and December 2025, and found
OL,14,Ftwo employees who did not have the
OL,15,Fright to work in the UK.
OL,17,FThe Home Office said the restaurant
OL,18,Falso owed #95,000 in unpaid fines,
OL,19,Fwhich came as a result of the officers'
OL,20,Ffindings.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
